OL,4,BSooryavanshi, 15, breaks sixes record  
OL,5,Bby scoring 204 off 53 balls            
OL,6,GIndia's 15-year-old batting sensation  
OL,7,GVaibhav Sooryavanshi hit the most      
OL,8,Gsixes ever recorded in a senior men's  
OL,9,Ginnings in blazing 204 from 53 balls   
OL,10,Gfor India A against the United Arab    
OL,11,GEmirates.                              
OL,13,FWhile almost halving the record for    
OL,14,Fthe fastest double-century in List A   
OL,15,Fcricket, Sooryavanshi hit 28 sixes and 
OL,16,Fseven fours in the Asia Cup Rising     
OL,17,FStars competition - easily breaking    
OL,18,FChad Bowes' previous record of 103     
OL,19,Fballs from 2024.                       
